{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Zxi6gaIP6u1792737535.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產大埔康樂園分行高級資深分區營業經理吳啟業表示，近期整體租賃交投持續向好，大埔翡翠花園最新錄43座中層B室，單位實用面積949平方呎，3房連套房及工人套房間隔，開價約31,000元，日前議價後以29,000元租出，實用平均呎租約30.6元。<br/>據了解，新租客為同區客，見屋苑環境舒適，少有放盤，單位間隔合用，即決定以租入單位自用。據了解，業主早於1990年以180萬元購入單位，是次租出單位可享19厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:22:27.668724+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T20:18:06.170303+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:12.134015+00:00","content_hash":"8febf9afaeed18fb8c21ab5f7ae5c03b74b7d02dd143683e54e70b9fc05d2149","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}